Inspect project port ranges (50-port blocks), deterministic service slots (0-9), and suggest ports (10-49) after a momentary IPv4 loopback bind probe. Suggestions are not durable reservations.

Usage:
  orbit port [command]

Available Commands:
  allocate    Suggest a bindable dynamic port; no reservation is retained
  list        List base ports and deterministic slots for all registered projects

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for port

Global Flags:
      --config string   Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

Use "orbit port [command] --help" for more information about a command.
